        "body_text": "<p>The same mechanism helping a 23-year-old athlete perform at their peak \u2014 and a 68-year-old keep a healthy blood pressure reading. One highway. Every kind of person running on it.<\/p>",
        "photo_1": "shopify://shop_images/kzabh10350-full-1-full-page-vertical-poc-1440-wide-design-source-of-truth-for-the-whole-story-page-13328902.jpg",
